HIGH    PRC001  Operation has no authentication
        specs/shop.yaml:9:5  GET /orders

           7 | paths:
           8 |   /orders:
        >  9 |     get:
          10 |       responses:
          11 |         "200":

        Why:  Anyone who can reach the API can call this operation, without
              proving who they are.
        Fix:  Add a security requirement to the operation or to the whole spec.
        More: https://github.com/EduardoMG12/procyon/blob/main/docs/rules/PRC001.md

MEDIUM  PRC004  Server URL does not use TLS
        specs/shop.yaml:6:12

          4 |   version: 1.0.0
          5 | servers:
        > 6 |   - url: http://api.example.com
          7 | paths:
          8 |   /orders:

        Why:  Traffic to this server is sent unencrypted, so anyone on the
              network path can read or change it, including credentials.
        Fix:  Use an https:// URL.
        More: https://github.com/EduardoMG12/procyon/blob/main/docs/rules/PRC004.md

LOW     PRC008  Unbounded input or output
        specs/shop.yaml:1:1

        > 1 | openapi: 3.0.3
          2 | info:
          3 |   title: Shop

        Why:  Nothing limits how big a request can be.
        Fix:  Add maxLength.
        More: https://github.com/EduardoMG12/procyon/blob/main/docs/rules/PRC008.md

LOW     PRC008  Unbounded input or output
        specs/shop.yaml:12:11

          10 |       responses:
          11 |         "200":
        > 12 |           description: Orders

        Why:  Nothing limits how big a response can be.
        Fix:  Add paging.
        More: https://github.com/EduardoMG12/procyon/blob/main/docs/rules/PRC008.md

